This device cannot keep a hidden list.
Show Hidden Games
Lists the games hidden with Hide Game, so one can be shown again from its menu. Each device keeps its own hidden.txt.
Delete %s? Goes: %d game file(s), %d settings file(s), %d art image(s) and %d cheat file(s). Kept: its VMC saves.
Another copy of this game is on this device, so its settings, art and cheats stay.
